<title>UK: SBC sets call and put warrants on the SMI index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call and put warrants on the SMI index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the SMI index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE     ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	4,500.0    3.06 CHF	 5.88 PCT     14.83 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT B	 4,500.0    2.65 CHF	 6.70 PCT     17.13 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  4,539.0</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
